<![CDATA[<font size="7" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>NEW CLOSED WON OPPORTUNITY!!&nbsp;</b></font><div style=""><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></b><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><font style="">Congratulations to&nbsp;<b style="">{!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}</b>&nbsp;for closing a deal with&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" style=""><b>{!Opportunity.Account}</b></font>!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Opportunity:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" size="2"><a href="{!Opportunity.Link}">{!Opportunity.Name}</a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: small;">Opportunity Type: </b><span style="font-size: small;">{!Opportunity.Type}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><b>ARR Amount:</b>&nbsp;{!Opportunity.Recurring_Amount_RU__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><b>One-Time Amount:</b>&nbsp;{!Opportunity.One_Time_Amount_RU__c}</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><b>Product(s):&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial" size="2">{!Opportunity.Product_Family_RU__c}<br></font><font size="2"><b>Dispute Chargeback Fee:&nbsp;</b></font><font face="arial" size="2">{!Opportunity.Charge_Back_Fee__c}<br></font><font size="2"><b>Lead Source:<span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font face="arial" size="2">{!Opportunity.LeadSource}</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><b style=""><font size="2">Incumbent:</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font face="arial" size="2">{!Opportunity.Incumbent__c}</font></div><div style=""><b style="font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Incumbent Other:&nbsp;</font></b><font face="arial" size="2">{!Opportunity.Incumbent_if_Other__c}</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><font size="2">Passport Team:&nbsp;</font></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul style=""><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><b>Opp Owner:&nbsp;</b></font><span style="font-size: small;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Opportunity.OwnerFullName}</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></li><li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><b>Client Success:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" size="2">{!Opportunity.Client_Success_Rep__c}</font></li></ul></div></div></div>]]></td>
